WEBVTT

00:00:04.570 --> 00:00:07.110
Because we’re an affiliated school, it seems that there are many...

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:11.270
...who rest easy because of the escalator system into college.

00:00:11.270 --> 00:00:14.240
However, as you’re all aware, whether or not you make it into college...

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:19.040
...depends on whether your test score average up through this term passes a certain mark.

00:00:20.010 --> 00:00:24.580
Especially for those in Class-F, every year, after the second term finals...

00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:28.240
...many of the students receive disappointing results.

00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:29.740
Many?

00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:33.910
Please work hard to make sure that doesn’t happen again this year.

00:02:09.640 --> 00:02:12.820
Kotoko-chan! Tea is ready!

00:02:12.820 --> 00:02:15.400
Okay...

00:02:16.190 --> 00:02:18.230
Here, sorry to keep you waiting.

00:02:18.700 --> 00:02:22.700
What’s wrong, Kotoko-chan? You’ve looked tired recently.

00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:25.700
Yeah. The final exams start next week.

00:02:26.190 --> 00:02:30.260
You mustn’t overwork yourself like that. It’s just studies.

00:02:31.180 --> 00:02:33.780
She has to overwork herself though.

00:02:33.780 --> 00:02:35.220
How come?

00:02:35.220 --> 00:02:39.130
The coming test decides whether or not she makes it into college.

00:02:39.130 --> 00:02:41.980
It’s quite a big problem
for someone in Class-F.

00:02:41.980 --> 00:02:45.480
In that case, you should tutor her!

00:02:45.480 --> 00:02:48.830
I’d rather not sacrifice my sleep for that.

00:02:49.360 --> 00:02:51.280
How cold!

00:02:51.280 --> 00:02:53.650
Why don’t you stop struggling
and just give up?

00:02:53.650 --> 00:02:56.870
What the heck! As if it had nothing to do with you!

00:02:57.420 --> 00:03:00.240
There’s no need for you to overwork yourself just to get into college anyway, right?

00:03:01.170 --> 00:03:03.160
Oh, that’s a good idea!

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:07.370
If you don’t make it into college, how about doing some housewife training here at our house?

00:03:08.870 --> 00:03:12.290
Right, Onii-chan? Don’t you think that’s a great idea?

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:14.300
I’m going to take a bath.

00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:18.460
I don’t want to eat the food that Kotoko is gonna make during her housewife training everyday.

00:03:18.460 --> 00:03:22.670
Why, this kid! His mouth really doesn’t get any better.

00:03:26.830 --> 00:03:31.110
No! No!

00:03:31.110 --> 00:03:32.100
I don’t get it!

00:03:33.280 --> 00:03:34.520
I don’t get it.

00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:38.350
Jinko, calm down.

00:03:38.350 --> 00:03:40.320
I give up!

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:47.790
I’ve never studied so much before!

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:51.110
I don’t get it at all.

00:03:51.110 --> 00:03:54.170
At this rate, it might be hopeless trying to get into college.

00:03:54.170 --> 00:03:54.910
Oh no.

00:03:54.910 --> 00:03:56.790
Let’s get married then.

00:03:58.550 --> 00:04:01.400
There’s no need to overwork yourself to get into college.

00:04:01.400 --> 00:04:03.760
Just become my wife.

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:06.750
Please don’t decide my life for me.

00:04:06.750 --> 00:04:07.810
I’m dead serious!

00:04:07.810 --> 00:04:12.810
My only ambition is to marry you, Kotoko!

00:04:14.390 --> 00:04:18.110
If I could be that carefree,
it’d be easy to give up.

00:04:18.110 --> 00:04:19.970
Call it “optimistic”.

00:04:19.970 --> 00:04:24.220
Now, now. Enough with the studying! Let’s just party!

00:04:24.220 --> 00:04:29.660
That’s right. It might be easier to just give up and live a carefree life like Kin-chan’s.

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:30.710
Jinko!

00:04:30.710 --> 00:04:33.290
You mustn’t get caught in his pace!

00:04:33.290 --> 00:04:34.250
But...

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:38.990
I got an idea. How does studying together after school sound?

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:41.090
That’s good!

00:04:41.090 --> 00:04:43.740
Three heads can solve problems
better than one!

00:04:43.740 --> 00:04:45.570
She’s right, Jinko.

00:04:45.570 --> 00:04:49.280
What is this? In that case, let me join in.

00:04:49.280 --> 00:04:52.520
No. I doubt we’d get any studying done with you around.

00:04:52.520 --> 00:04:54.260
Oh, really?

00:04:54.260 --> 00:04:56.320
Don’t come crying to me later if you regret it.

00:04:56.320 --> 00:04:58.650
I’ll get the best score in Class-F.

00:04:58.650 --> 00:04:59.700
Ain’t happening.

00:04:59.700 --> 00:05:01.400
All three of you at once?!

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:02.750
Anyway, about that...

00:05:02.750 --> 00:05:03.610
Ignored, huh?

00:05:03.610 --> 00:05:05.660
Where should we have it?

00:05:08.990 --> 00:05:10.700
Naturally...

00:05:11.820 --> 00:05:13.010
I’m home!

00:05:13.010 --> 00:05:14.290
Pardon the intrusion!

00:05:15.130 --> 00:05:19.290
Oh, my! Kotoko-chan,
you brought your friends.

00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:21.880
Sorry about this, Oba-sama.
This came up...

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:23.760
No, it’s fine.

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:28.270
I’m delighted. We’ve never had so many girls in the house before.

00:05:28.270 --> 00:05:30.250
Please come in.

00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:31.760
Pardon us.

00:05:32.540 --> 00:05:35.020
Ah, how are you, little brother?

00:05:35.920 --> 00:05:37.800
The extra class bunch again?

00:05:41.500 --> 00:05:43.990
Welcome home, Kotoko-chan.

00:05:43.990 --> 00:05:46.490
Seems like he might just say that.

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:48.730
What a cheerful room...

00:05:48.730 --> 00:05:50.700
Your taste is really
something else, Kotoko.

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:52.480
Well, you see, Oba-sama...

00:05:52.480 --> 00:05:54.290
Hey, where’s Irie’s room?

00:05:54.290 --> 00:05:55.330
Right across.

00:05:56.360 --> 00:05:59.840
The genius is right across the hallway.

00:05:59.840 --> 00:06:03.590
I want to take a peek at what a pretty boy genius’s life is like.

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:07.660
You two didn’t come here
for that reason, right?

00:06:07.660 --> 00:06:09.580
Of course not.

00:06:09.580 --> 00:06:11.180
We wouldn’t do that.

00:06:11.680 --> 00:06:13.100
I wonder how true that is.

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:14.150
Okay then!

00:06:14.150 --> 00:06:15.070
Let’s do this!

00:06:21.820 --> 00:06:25.820
I don’t get it!

00:06:26.570 --> 00:06:27.820
Shut up!

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:32.440
We’re not gonna be able to solve anything since the three of us are all equally bad!

00:06:32.440 --> 00:06:34.680
We’ve barely started though.

00:06:34.680 --> 00:06:36.330
Isn’t it a bit early to give up?

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:37.840
You have it easy though.

00:06:37.840 --> 00:06:41.360
That’s right.
You did get fiftieth on the midterm.

00:06:41.360 --> 00:06:43.100
So your average is up.

00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:46.070
Oh, yeah! It is, isn’t it?

00:06:46.070 --> 00:06:47.800
So, you’re that kind of person?!

00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:51.970
Say, this would be a cinch for Irie, wouldn’t it?

00:06:52.270 --> 00:06:55.970
He’d probably be able to solve it in two or three seconds.

00:06:59.290 --> 00:07:02.570
What are you two thinking?

00:07:02.570 --> 00:07:05.320
He would help if you’re the one
who asks, right?

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:09.170
He won’t! He’s always cold
and indifferent to me!

00:07:09.170 --> 00:07:11.680
What about the time you got into the top fifty?

00:07:12.820 --> 00:07:17.330
Well, I had a little trick back then.

00:07:18.410 --> 00:07:20.500
Anyway, it’s definitely impossible!

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:22.610
You won’t know unless you try, right?

00:07:23.520 --> 00:07:24.670
You guys really insist?

00:07:29.100 --> 00:07:30.430
I’d rather not.

00:07:30.430 --> 00:07:32.430
Yeah, of course...

00:07:33.400 --> 00:07:35.440
Go, go, Kotoko!

00:07:36.100 --> 00:07:41.270
Well, can you please help us with just this one question?

00:07:41.270 --> 00:07:43.650
I’d like you to teach me.

00:07:43.650 --> 00:07:46.710
It’s a waste of time to teach you.

00:07:47.580 --> 00:07:49.180
It’s not a waste!

00:07:49.180 --> 00:07:52.340
With you just spending a second or two to solve this problem,

00:07:52.340 --> 00:07:55.850
it would at the very least ensure the futures of three girls!

00:07:55.850 --> 00:07:57.540
Good going, Kotoko!

00:07:57.540 --> 00:07:58.920
You don’t have to exaggerate.

00:07:58.920 --> 00:08:00.610
I’m not exaggerating!

00:08:00.610 --> 00:08:02.760
This one! This question!

00:08:02.760 --> 00:08:05.640
What part of this don’t you understand?

00:08:05.640 --> 00:08:07.760
What part? Everything.

00:08:07.760 --> 00:08:09.760
Unbelievable.

00:08:09.760 --> 00:08:11.760
Onii-chan, her stupidity will infect you.

00:08:12.360 --> 00:08:16.270
Can you tell me how to solve it?
Pretty please.

00:08:18.530 --> 00:08:19.690
Hand it over.

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:26.110
Is this good enough for you?
Please don’t disturb me again.

00:08:26.110 --> 00:08:27.950
Thanks.

00:08:32.120 --> 00:08:34.080
That was amazing!

00:08:34.080 --> 00:08:35.820
He didn’t even stop to look!

00:08:35.820 --> 00:08:37.510
It really did only take him two seconds!

00:08:38.120 --> 00:08:40.630
I see, so that’s how you solve it!

00:08:40.630 --> 00:08:41.950
So simple, isn’t it?

00:08:41.950 --> 00:08:44.460
As expected, he makes it so easy to understand!

00:08:44.460 --> 00:08:45.650
Next question then!

00:08:45.650 --> 00:08:46.840
Let’s give it a shot!

00:08:54.160 --> 00:08:56.640
Excuse me... We need help with the second question too...

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:06.550
Thank you very much.

00:09:12.720 --> 00:09:15.070
Pardon me again...

00:09:22.280 --> 00:09:24.480
Thank you very much.

00:09:30.880 --> 00:09:32.680
Excuse me...

00:09:32.680 --> 00:09:33.930
Quit it already!

00:09:34.950 --> 00:09:35.920
I’m sorry!

00:09:35.920 --> 00:09:38.310
I’m not your damn teacher!

00:09:38.310 --> 00:09:40.620
Come back in fifteen minutes!

00:09:41.170 --> 00:09:44.090
Kotoko, could it be that...

00:09:44.090 --> 00:09:47.110
....he’s going to solve all of it?

00:09:47.110 --> 00:09:51.550
No way. Doing it all in fifteen minutes is...

00:09:53.160 --> 00:09:56.650
Incredible! It even comes with explanations on how to solve it!

00:09:56.650 --> 00:09:59.990
All this in fifteen minutes?!

00:09:59.990 --> 00:10:02.990
It even tells you which parts are going to show up on the test!

00:10:02.990 --> 00:10:07.550
It’s going to be a breeze for Irie to get into college.

00:10:07.550 --> 00:10:12.260
What are you saying? Someone with his brains surely isn’t going to enroll into our college.

00:10:12.260 --> 00:10:13.680
Oh, really?

00:10:13.680 --> 00:10:16.150
Naturally, it’ll be Tokyo University.

00:10:16.150 --> 00:10:19.210
Oh, I guess she’s right.

00:10:19.210 --> 00:10:24.270
Soon, Irie and I will be going to different colleges and be separated...

00:10:24.270 --> 00:10:26.990
We’re saved now for physics.

00:10:26.990 --> 00:10:28.860
What about subjects other than physics?

00:10:32.700 --> 00:10:33.650
Hey.

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:36.570
Kotoko!

00:10:37.730 --> 00:10:42.240
I can’t! Do you know how hard it was for me to get him to teach us yesterday?!

00:10:42.240 --> 00:10:45.160
Please find a way!

00:10:45.160 --> 00:10:47.120
Are you all idiots?!

00:10:47.120 --> 00:10:50.860
I don’t understand why you’d want him to teach you!

00:10:50.860 --> 00:10:53.170
Don’t you all have even
a little bit of pride?

00:10:54.290 --> 00:10:57.430
Now is not the time to be so easygoing, is it, Kin-chan?

00:10:57.430 --> 00:11:00.890
I’d throw away as much of my pride as it takes in order to open up my future.

00:11:01.510 --> 00:11:03.390
Why you!

00:11:03.940 --> 00:11:06.590
This is kinda over the top.

00:11:07.230 --> 00:11:10.140
Well, with that... It’s up to you, Kotoko!

00:11:11.160 --> 00:11:13.650
You’re the only one we can rely on.

00:11:13.650 --> 00:11:17.700
Well, even if you tell me that...

00:11:17.700 --> 00:11:20.490
What should I do?

00:11:29.710 --> 00:11:30.760
I’m back.

00:11:30.760 --> 00:11:33.280
Welcome back!

00:11:37.590 --> 00:11:39.450
Irie-kun, please!

00:11:39.450 --> 00:11:41.840
Please tutor us!

00:11:41.840 --> 00:11:43.340
Please!

00:11:43.340 --> 00:11:44.570
Kotoko!

00:11:45.490 --> 00:11:46.450
Yes?

00:11:46.450 --> 00:11:48.420
Would you cut this nonsense out?!

00:11:48.420 --> 00:11:53.540
Well, as their savior,
please rescue their futures.

00:11:53.540 --> 00:11:55.560
They’ll be eternally grateful.

00:11:55.560 --> 00:11:57.320
I don’t need their gratitude!

00:11:57.320 --> 00:11:59.230
Irie-kun!

00:11:59.230 --> 00:12:01.240
No, Irie-sama!

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:03.510
Please, somehow...!

00:12:09.360 --> 00:12:11.750
Next, page 74.

00:12:11.750 --> 00:12:15.030
So, we’ll focus on actually determining the integral.

00:12:15.030 --> 00:12:19.330
In other words, we’ll finally be learning how to integrate f(x).

00:12:19.330 --> 00:12:22.260
First, the definite integral from <i>a</i> to <i>x</i>.

00:12:22.260 --> 00:12:24.270
Here, <i>a</i> is a real number, correct?

00:12:24.270 --> 00:12:26.220
When <i>a</i> isn’t -1...

00:12:26.220 --> 00:12:29.300
He’s tutoring her school friends.

00:12:29.300 --> 00:12:32.230
Onii-chan has changed a little since Kotoko-chan arrived, hasn’t he?

00:12:33.280 --> 00:12:37.800
It’s really interesting to see Naoki get strung along by Kotoko-chan.

00:12:39.310 --> 00:12:41.230
Thank you very much!

00:12:41.230 --> 00:12:43.820
I don’t mind at all.

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:45.810
Please be safe on your way home.

00:12:50.470 --> 00:12:51.980
Thanks for today.

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:54.130
You must be tired.

00:12:54.670 --> 00:12:56.370
Of course.

00:12:56.370 --> 00:13:00.250
I never expected them to ask for help on every single subject.

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:05.610
But, this would probably help them get through the tests.

00:13:05.610 --> 00:13:07.160
And myself as well.

00:13:08.010 --> 00:13:10.680
I’m sorry for always being so demanding.

00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:12.520
Good night then.

00:13:13.930 --> 00:13:15.390
Hey.

00:13:16.230 --> 00:13:19.100
Why do you want to get into college?

00:13:19.100 --> 00:13:23.740
Why? To study, and make friends, and such.

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:27.240
You’re going to exert that much effort just to study something you won’t understand?

00:13:27.240 --> 00:13:29.490
Well, I am, but...

00:13:29.490 --> 00:13:35.010
I just can’t understand why everyone wants to get into college so badly.

00:13:35.010 --> 00:13:37.760
Well, you wouldn’t understand our feelings since you’re Irie-kun,

00:13:37.760 --> 00:13:40.410
the one who’d naturally get
into Tokyo University.

00:13:40.410 --> 00:13:43.590
I’m not thinking of going to college.

00:13:45.970 --> 00:13:48.680
Besides, why is there a need to go in the first place?

00:13:48.680 --> 00:13:52.680
Well, it’s to study for what you want to do in the future.

00:13:52.680 --> 00:13:55.230
So, what do you want to be?

00:13:56.550 --> 00:13:59.560
Well, I can’t give an immediate answer just like that.

00:13:59.560 --> 00:14:00.850
Right?

00:14:03.820 --> 00:14:07.650
But, isn’t that why we go in search of it?

00:14:07.650 --> 00:14:12.510
You might find what you want to spend your entire life doing while you’re there.

00:14:13.700 --> 00:14:19.640
In other words, college is an important time, searching for what you want to be in the future.

00:14:19.640 --> 00:14:21.710
You really are amazing.

00:14:21.710 --> 00:14:26.670
I’ve been thinking this for a while, but how are you able to try so hard?

00:14:26.670 --> 00:14:28.800
No, I don’t try that hard.

00:14:28.800 --> 00:14:32.300
And yet, it’s impressive that
you still can’t do it.

00:14:32.300 --> 00:14:34.370
Is that sarcasm?

00:14:35.280 --> 00:14:37.680
I’m sort of jealous.

00:14:39.210 --> 00:14:40.950
I’m going to bed.

00:14:43.420 --> 00:14:46.900
Irie-kun, you shouldn’t keep that brain of yours only for yourself!

00:14:46.900 --> 00:14:50.600
You have to contribute to the development of Japan by going to Tokyo University!

00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:54.260
The scale of our conversation sure got big.

00:14:57.500 --> 00:15:00.500
I guess geniuses have their own worries.

00:15:01.990 --> 00:15:07.600
I feel like I’ve just taken a small peek into Irie-kun’s heart.

00:15:13.650 --> 00:15:15.070
How did it go?

00:15:17.720 --> 00:15:20.600
Me too. But, it was amazing, wasn’t it?

00:15:20.600 --> 00:15:23.110
All of the problems came right from the sections that Irie predicted!

00:15:23.110 --> 00:15:26.270
This is the first time I’ve done
this well on a test.

00:15:27.360 --> 00:15:29.610
Kin-chan, are you okay?

00:15:29.610 --> 00:15:33.080
It seems like you did well where I couldn’t, Kotoko.

00:15:33.080 --> 00:15:34.960
Don’t feel down.

00:15:34.960 --> 00:15:37.500
Just marry me.

00:15:40.630 --> 00:15:43.010
I think you should get some sleep first.

00:15:44.330 --> 00:15:49.130
All of you did unexpectedly well on this term’s finals.

00:15:49.130 --> 00:15:51.040
Practically all of you can rest easy.

00:15:51.100 --> 00:15:53.020
Hooray!

00:15:54.470 --> 00:15:55.970
Hooray!

00:15:57.090 --> 00:16:00.430
Now I can become a college student in Spring!

00:16:00.430 --> 00:16:03.630
Ikezawa Kinnosuke, please see me in the counseling room later.

00:16:04.960 --> 00:16:09.580
Life isn’t all about going to college. There are many other choices.

00:16:09.580 --> 00:16:10.950
Even my good friend...

00:16:12.240 --> 00:16:15.060
Why don’t we get a present for Irie?

00:16:15.060 --> 00:16:16.120
Present?

00:16:16.120 --> 00:16:19.680
Yeah. This was all possible because of Irie.

00:16:19.680 --> 00:16:21.870
I’m sure everyone would like to give something to him.

00:16:21.870 --> 00:16:23.980
A present...

00:16:23.980 --> 00:16:27.360
Yeah, I’d like to get him something as well.

00:16:27.360 --> 00:16:32.300
It’s almost Christmas. And I’ve caused Irie nothing but trouble.

00:16:33.260 --> 00:16:36.850
But then again, if I give him a sweater...

00:16:37.150 --> 00:16:38.350
Please accept...

00:16:38.350 --> 00:16:39.980
I don’t want it.

00:16:40.760 --> 00:16:43.230
...that nightmare might repeat itself.

00:16:43.230 --> 00:16:45.060
I can’t knit to begin with.

00:16:45.060 --> 00:16:47.480
Quick relief for stiff shoulders.

00:16:47.480 --> 00:16:54.240
In all sorts of situations, you’ll have your 99.999% pure germanium bracelet with you!

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:59.240
Even Santa’s shoulder stiffness is now nothing! Good!

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:02.450
Irie-kun often hits his shoulders and such too.

00:17:02.450 --> 00:17:03.670
This might be good!

00:17:06.010 --> 00:17:10.490
25,000 yen? I definitely won’t have enough with just my allowance.

00:17:11.450 --> 00:17:13.180
What should I do?

00:17:15.430 --> 00:17:16.980
Welcome!

00:17:18.010 --> 00:17:20.730
One large beef noodles and miso soup.

00:17:20.730 --> 00:17:22.100
Regular and an egg.

00:17:22.100 --> 00:17:26.350
Right. One large bowl, medium bowl, miso soup and omelette coming right up.

00:17:26.350 --> 00:17:28.520
They sure hired a nice girl.

00:17:28.520 --> 00:17:31.200
Large pork broth with eggs. Thank you for waiting.

00:17:38.530 --> 00:17:39.660
That reminds me...

00:17:39.660 --> 00:17:43.500
It seems like the guys from Class-F got rather high scores this time.

00:17:43.500 --> 00:17:44.580
How strange.

00:17:46.060 --> 00:17:47.750
What’s wrong?

00:17:51.380 --> 00:17:55.880
Irie-kun is the only one who mustn’t see me like this.

00:17:58.390 --> 00:18:00.890
She’s the one who confessed to you...

00:18:00.890 --> 00:18:03.030
Koto-chan, I’ve come again.

00:18:03.030 --> 00:18:04.140
Welcome!

00:18:04.140 --> 00:18:05.960
A regular bowl?

00:18:05.960 --> 00:18:09.340
She’s really into it.

00:18:14.150 --> 00:18:15.420
I’m back.

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:21.050
Merry Christmas!

00:18:22.880 --> 00:18:24.520
He doesn’t look surprised...

00:18:24.520 --> 00:18:26.450
You didn’t blurt it out did you, Kotoko?

00:18:26.450 --> 00:18:28.820
I never mentioned it!

00:18:28.820 --> 00:18:32.380
Maybe you should have hidden those shoes in the foyer if you wanted to surprise me.

00:18:34.220 --> 00:18:35.760
Well then, enjoy yourselves.

00:18:35.760 --> 00:18:38.970
Wait, Irie-kun! The students from Class-F have a present for you.

00:18:38.970 --> 00:18:41.400
Satomi and I are here to represent them.

00:18:41.400 --> 00:18:44.010
Our token of appreciation from everyone in Class-F!

00:18:44.600 --> 00:18:46.350
Why, thank you...

00:18:50.770 --> 00:18:52.360
How cute!

00:18:52.360 --> 00:18:54.360
Made by all of us.

00:18:54.360 --> 00:18:56.580
I’m sorry, but can I throw it away?

00:18:56.580 --> 00:18:58.320
That’s mean...

00:18:58.320 --> 00:19:00.790
No, it just feels like I’ll get cursed...

00:19:00.790 --> 00:19:02.340
No, you can’t, Onii-chan.

00:19:03.850 --> 00:19:07.870
Come! The food is ready. Eat up!

00:19:10.710 --> 00:19:12.130
Delicious!

00:19:13.380 --> 00:19:14.020
Mama.

00:19:14.020 --> 00:19:14.960
Papa.

00:19:14.960 --> 00:19:16.380
Cheers!

00:19:21.130 --> 00:19:24.890
I have a present for the Irie family too.

00:19:24.890 --> 00:19:27.350
It’s a token of my appreciation for taking care of us.

00:19:27.350 --> 00:19:29.890
Oh, you didn’t have to, Kotoko-chan.

00:19:29.890 --> 00:19:32.570
Irie-kun, this is for you.

00:19:33.160 --> 00:19:35.400
It’s not another doll of you, right?

00:19:35.400 --> 00:19:37.320
It’s not!

00:19:41.990 --> 00:19:44.180
What’s that?

00:19:44.180 --> 00:19:45.910
Germanium?

00:19:45.910 --> 00:19:49.760
I thought it might be good for your health.

00:19:49.760 --> 00:19:51.160
It takes away fatigue, I heard.

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:53.920
I’m not an old man.

00:19:53.920 --> 00:19:55.920
I made a bad choice...

00:19:55.920 --> 00:19:58.910
Kotoko-chan, wasn’t that expensive?

00:19:59.820 --> 00:20:01.880
I managed to get it with an easy job.

00:20:01.880 --> 00:20:04.390
What kind of work did you do?

00:20:04.990 --> 00:20:07.780
A bit of waitressing at a restaurant.

00:20:11.250 --> 00:20:14.820
Here. This is from Papa and I
to you, Kotoko-chan.

00:20:14.820 --> 00:20:16.270
For me?

00:20:19.300 --> 00:20:21.530
A picture stand! Thank you!

00:20:21.530 --> 00:20:24.330
Onii-chan, what do you have
for Kotoko-chan?

00:20:24.330 --> 00:20:25.570
I don’t have anything, obviously.

00:20:25.570 --> 00:20:27.780
I figured you wouldn’t, so I had an idea.

00:20:27.780 --> 00:20:29.410
Idea?

00:20:30.020 --> 00:20:34.540
How about a photo of the two of you squished right next to each other?

00:20:35.400 --> 00:20:37.550
But, “squished right next to”...

00:20:37.550 --> 00:20:39.300
Why not? It’s just a picture.

00:20:39.300 --> 00:20:42.720
Irie-kun surely wouldn’t agree to it.

00:20:42.720 --> 00:20:43.770
It’s fine by me.

00:20:44.510 --> 00:20:47.510
However, only one photo and no more.

00:20:48.430 --> 00:20:49.890
Onii-chan, you’re so wonderful!

00:20:49.890 --> 00:20:52.140
I understand! Only one photo, right?

00:20:52.140 --> 00:20:53.550
Come.

00:20:53.550 --> 00:20:55.020
Okay, umm...

00:20:55.020 --> 00:20:55.900
Sheesh.

00:20:57.990 --> 00:20:59.480
Is this good?

00:21:03.160 --> 00:21:06.740
That’s good! Onii-chan, you’re the best! Keep that pose!

00:21:07.680 --> 00:21:10.340
What’s gotten into Irie-kun?

00:21:10.340 --> 00:21:13.000
For him to do such a thing...

00:21:13.000 --> 00:21:15.330
Is this a miracle?

00:21:16.420 --> 00:21:18.160
Welcome.

00:21:19.210 --> 00:21:20.970
Regular, one bowl.

00:21:21.920 --> 00:21:23.090
No way!

00:21:24.280 --> 00:21:26.250
Ah, Kotoko-chan!

00:21:27.300 --> 00:21:31.280
Irie-kun is teasing me again!

00:23:07.360 --> 00:23:09.700
How’s your entrance exam
studying going, Naoki?

00:23:09.700 --> 00:23:13.210
He’ll definitely pass the Tokyo University entrance exams, Oji-sama!

00:23:13.210 --> 00:23:15.450
I haven’t decided if I’ll go to
Tokyo University yet.

00:23:15.450 --> 00:23:18.010
What?! You’re not allowed to
decide that on you own!

00:23:18.010 --> 00:23:20.440
There, there, Papa. Onii-chan will be fine.

00:23:20.440 --> 00:23:23.000
More important, Kotoko-chan. It’s Valentine’s Day tomorrow.

00:23:23.000 --> 00:23:25.190
Be sure to succeed with your handmade chocolate!

00:23:25.190 --> 00:23:26.330
Yes!

00:23:26.330 --> 00:23:28.260
Next time on Itazura na Kiss:

00:23:28.260 --> 00:23:30.270
Chocolates, Exams, and the Jinx.

00:23:30.270 --> 00:23:32.420
I’m definitely gonna be happy.
